'''Whiskingmeister''' (ウィスキングマイスター, ''Wisukingumaisutā'', '''Whiskingmeister''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Kory]] that appears in [[Summer Break Cats Paradise#Sauna of Paradise|Sauna of Paradise]]. It was added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Whiskingmeister
|image = E 741.png
|first appearance = [[Aufguss Sauna]]
|money drop = 900¢ - 3,555¢
}}

==Enemy==
This chill [[Kory]] exchanges [[Base Destroyer]] for a 30% chance to [[Knockback]] cats. He moves a bit slower than his original variant, and has a comparitively weaker attack than most Kories encountered throughout the game, even at high magnifications. Even so, Whiskingmeister is quite tanky and can create dangerous openings for enemies, so watch out!

==Strategy==
Truth be told, this enemy is pretty weak. Having a wave blocker like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] or [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine Mk 3]] can remove most of the difficulty from this enemy, and you can just treat it like a buffed [[Wall Doge]] with a chance to Knockback your Cats. [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]] can be used to sneak in heavy damage, but he is outranged so timing is required to get the most hits. This can be partially alleviated by using [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless]] Crowd-Controllers like [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Vendor Cat and Kitten]].

